DESCRIPTION:presented by Generation Noir Datum: 16.09.2026 | Einlass: 18:00 Uhr Beginn: 18:30 | Ende: Uhr  DENUIT (Montepellier\, France) Fans of Twin Tribes or Boy Harsher? Meet DENUIT\, a darkwave/synthpop duo with a gothic techno and industrial edge. With Lis’s hypnotic\, siren like voice and Ivi’s unique synths\, their live shows captivate audiences across Europe\, Mexico\, and South America. Mystical yet intense\, their sound blends dark atmospheres\, pounding kicks\, and vibrating basslines for an experience that enchants… and hits hard. DENUIT represents the new generation of electro goth artists shaking clubs and festivals worldwide. Support: DARINA (UA/AT) Half electronic\, half heartbeat\, Darina’s music lingers long after the sound fades - haunting vocals float over raw synths and grungy textures\, blending intimacy with intensity. Blending darkwave and alternative pop\, her sound is atmospheric\, emotional\, and edged with tension. At 19\, the Vienna based independent artist carries her Ukrainian roots into every track\, infusing her music with the imprint of home\, displacement\, and memory. After the war uprooted her life\, music became her constant - the thread she refused to let go of. In Vienna’s underground scene\, Darina is an emerging voice: independent\, experimental\, and unmistakably her own.
URL:https://rhiz.wien/copilotevent/16-09-2026_denuit_darina
END:VEVENT
